  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"本接口可以批量暂停明点无效素材，需先通过【【代理商】明点无效素材查询】接口查询无效素材。不支持暂停自动化素材，自动化素材可通过【批量更新营销素材启用状态】暂停，素材清理范围限「同质化素材」。\",\"id\":\"agent.material.pause\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/video/pause/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1779985717273613\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"agent.material.query\",\"path\":\"/open_api/xxx/material/query/\",\"reason\":\"需要先通过此接口查询无效素材才能进行暂停操作\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"【代理商】明点无效素材查询\"},{\"id\":\"material.status.update\",\"path\":\"/open_api/xxx/material/status/update/\",\"reason\":\"自动化素材需要通过此接口进行暂停\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"批量更新营销素材启用状态\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1779985717273613\",\"title\":\"【代理商】批量暂停明点无效素材\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-A64xQZhl\">通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1779971491239040\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">【代理商】明点无效素材查询</span></a>】接口查询无效素材，然后进行暂停</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-UzbfKTE5\">本接口不支持暂停自动化素材，自动化素材可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1755355780973568\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">批量更新营销素材启用状态</span></a>】暂停</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3355e5th\">素材清理范围限「同质化素材」</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201779278036136003%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-c5dU7oo9\" id=\"h346b9f0-c5dU7oo9\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-C87vuI8m\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/video/pause/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/video/pause/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1779985717273613\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-r